commits.message:
fix(ci): portable zip finds grok-app.exe (Windows product binary)

Tauri builds target/release/grok-app.exe from the Cargo package name;
script looked only for Grok.exe and aborted the green-zip step.

docs: slim GitHub Release body to changelog-only for v0.1.6

Drop repeated downloads table and install essays from release notes;
point to README for Gatekeeper/xattr. Write ## [0.1.6] from Unreleased.

fix(ui): dedupe clipboard paste files across files and items APIs

WebViews often expose the same screenshot via both data.files and items;
stable file keys ignore lastModified so attach paths and blobs only once.

feat(tasks): cross-session activity in Tasks panel

Show other busy chats (streaming / permission / connecting) with Open and Stop;
keep per-turn tool tasks for the current chat.

feat(plugins): marketplace pro install recovery and empty honesty

Classify install/list errors with soft-fail for CLI missing/too old;
row-stuck Retry with kind chips; honest catalog empty states and CTAs.

feat(composer): send queue pro clear and empty honesty

Clear-all goes through GlassModal with honest count (never window.confirm);
pure planClearSendQueue / strip + empty-state helpers; reorder kept;
cleared toast; en/zh/zh-TW + tests.

chore: record clipboard-win as a grok-app lockfile dependency

Windows CF_HDROP paste already depends on clipboard-win in Cargo.toml;
the lockfile package list now matches.

docs(plans): sidebar quota moves into UserMenu (design + plan)

Approved approach A: compact remain beside name; full card at menu top;
identity row opens the menu.
